      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et lui, c’est mon Mime Jr. ! Il va m’aider\ndans ma collecte du courrier.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Miiime !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900690069006D0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est son tout premier jour, et je dois avouer\nque je m’inquiète un peu pour lui.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aurais bien voulu le suivre pour veiller sur lui,\nmais il risque de me repérer facilement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu voudrais pas me rendre un service ?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’aimerais que tu gardes un œil sur Mime Jr.\npendant qu’il fait sa tournée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fais-moi signe dès que tu te sentiras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\nà me rendre ce service !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, tu es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à garder un œil sur Mime Jr.\npendant sa première collecte du courrier ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Compte sur moi !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D00700074006500200073007500720020006D006F0069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore...",
